			"notes": "A new Dicely version, after.. some time :)\n---\n\nWhat's new you ask? \n\n - /roll - this should make using the mod a lot easier, it's an alias for /dicely\n - /dicely now has more arguments! use copy or history after it to get more info\n - using /roll or /dicely by itself also explains how to use it\n - better formatting of the rolls! :game_die: \n - Newer version support!"
