			"notes": "Welcome to Dicely! :game_die:  :sparkles:\nApparently, the first mod to introduce client sided command based dice rolls\n---\n\nThis mod is a lightweight client sided mod that, as the title says, does custom dice rolls.\nOther mods all have server side implementations, items, or other things that are not just this core feature, which I thought should be a must for e.g. D&D or other role playing games. \n\n---\n\nCurrently implemented features are:\n - Dice throws with /dicely <sides> <count>\n - Copy the last throw to your clipboard with /dicely copy\n - Get the last 10 throws with /dicely history\n - Also, /dicely gives info on how to roll dice\n\n---\n\nFor the future, maybe I will implement optional \"dice rolling sounds\", or other kinda neat things, but for the core features, this is it."
		}
